<div class="tab-content" id="special-cases" role="tabpanel">
<h2>
    UtiliKit Special Cases &amp; Limitations
</h2>
<h3>
    1. <strong>Grid Template Limitations</strong>
</h3>
<ul>
    <li>
        <strong>Nested repeat() functions</strong>: uk-gc--repeat-2-repeat-2-1fr-100px ❌ (CSS doesn't support nested repeat)
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Complex nested functions</strong>: uk-gc--repeat-3-minmax-200px-fitc-150px ❌ (Too complex for parser)
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>fit-content() with auto-fit/fill</strong>: uk-gc--repeat-auto-fit-fitc-200px ❌ (Browser limitations)
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Intrinsic sizing with auto-fit</strong>: uk-gc--repeat-auto-fit-minc ❌ (CSS spec limitation)
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>auto with auto-fit/fill</strong>: uk-gc--repeat-auto-fit-auto ❌ (Not allowed by CSS spec)
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Incomplete grid functions</strong>: uk-gc--repeat-3, uk-gc--minmax, uk-gc--fitc ❌ (Missing required values)
    </li>
</ul>
<h3>
    2. <strong>Decimal Number Format Changes</strong>
</h3>
<ul>
    <li>
        <strong>Old format no longer supported</strong>: uk-lh--1.5 ❌
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Must use 'd' format</strong>: uk-lh--1d5 ✅
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Applies to all properties</strong>: Line height, flex-grow, flex-shrink, etc.
    </li>
</ul>
<h3>
    3. <strong>CSS Validation Restrictions</strong>
</h3>
<ul>
    <li>
        <strong>Colors must be hex</strong>: RGB/RGBA/HSL color formats not supported in classes
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>3 or 6 digit hex only</strong>: uk-bg--ff0000 or uk-bg--f00
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>No CSS variables</strong>: Can't use uk-bg--var(--my-color)
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>No calc() expressions</strong>: Can't use uk-wd--calc(100%-20px)
    </li>
</ul>
<h3>
    4. <strong>Unit Limitations</strong>
</h3>
<ul>
    <li>
        <strong>Viewport units restricted</strong>: vh and vw only work with: wd, ht, xw, xh, nw, nh, fs
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>No ch, ex, or vmin/vmax units</strong>: Only px, %, em, rem, vh, vw supported
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Border-radius can't use auto</strong>: uk-br--t-auto ❌
    </li>
</ul>
<h3>
    5. <strong>Complex Pattern Restrictions</strong>
</h3>
<ul>
    <li>
        <strong>Maximum 4 values in shorthand</strong>: uk-pd--10-20-30-40 ✅ but not 5+ values
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>No mixed units in shorthand</strong>: Can't mix px and % in same shorthand
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Grid patterns with trailing values</strong>: uk-gc--repeat-2-minmax-200px-fitc-100px-1fr ❌ (Ambiguous)
    </li>
</ul>
<h3>
    6. <strong>Browser Compatibility Issues</strong>
</h3>
<ul>
    <li>
        <strong>fit-content() reliability</strong>: May not work consistently across all browsers
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Complex grid patterns</strong>: Some browsers may interpret grid templates differently
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Transform stacking</strong>: Can't combine multiple transforms in one class
    </li>
</ul>
<h3>
    7. <strong>Responsive Breakpoint Limitations</strong>
</h3>
<ul>
    <li>
        <strong>One breakpoint per class</strong>: Can't do uk-sm-md-pd--20
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>No range queries</strong>: Can't specify "between sm and lg"
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Fixed breakpoint values</strong>: Can't customize breakpoint sizes via classes
    </li>
</ul>
<h3>
    8. <strong>Property-Specific Limitations</strong>
</h3>
<ul>
    <li>
        <strong>Gap property</strong>: Only accepts integer values, not decimals
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Opacity</strong>: Values 0-100 only (converted to 0-1)
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Z-index</strong>: Integer values only, including negative
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Font-weight</strong>: Only 100-900 in steps of 100
    </li>
</ul>
<h3>
    9. <strong>Not Supported Features</strong>
</h3>
<ul>
    <li>
        <strong>Pseudo-element styling</strong>: Can't target ::before, ::after via utility classes
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Pseudo-class styling</strong>: No :hover, :focus states in utility classes
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Animation/transition utilities</strong>: No built-in animation classes
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Custom property utilities</strong>: Can't set CSS custom properties
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Gradient utilities</strong>: No gradient background support
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Filter utilities</strong>: No blur, brightness, etc.
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Backdrop filter utilities</strong>: Not supported
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Logical properties</strong>: No inline-start, block-end, etc.
    </li>
</ul>
<h3>
    10. <strong>Parser Edge Cases</strong>
</h3>
<ul>
    <li>
        <strong>Consecutive hyphens</strong>: Patterns with -- in values may fail
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Special characters</strong>: Values with special CSS characters need escaping
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Very long values</strong>: Parser may have limits on value length
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Unicode in values</strong>: Non-ASCII characters not tested
    </li>
</ul>

</div>
